[
  {
    "start": "00:00:03.534",
    "end": "00:00:07.371",
    "start_seconds": 3.534,
    "end_seconds": 7.371,
    "text": "Soundtrack for the apocalypse is silent."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:08.439",
    "end": "00:00:11.242",
    "start_seconds": 8.439,
    "end_seconds": 11.242,
    "text": "We felt the weight of that total absence of sound"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:11.275",
    "end": "00:00:15.079",
    "start_seconds": 11.275,
    "end_seconds": 15.079,
    "text": "when we arrived in the devastated neighborhoods of Altadena"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:15.112",
    "end": "00:00:16.647",
    "start_seconds": 15.112,
    "end_seconds": 16.647,
    "text": "and the Palisades"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:16.647",
    "end": "00:00:19.917",
    "start_seconds": 16.647,
    "end_seconds": 19.917,
    "text": "after the January 2025 firestorm."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:20.785",
    "end": "00:00:25.389",
    "start_seconds": 20.785,
    "end_seconds": 25.389,
    "text": "Our small crew of two or three was usually alone for blocks and blocks."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:25.923",
    "end": "00:00:30.628",
    "start_seconds": 25.923,
    "end_seconds": 30.628,
    "text": "There was no sound of cars or children or people or pool pumps"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:30.661",
    "end": "00:00:32.763",
    "start_seconds": 30.661,
    "end_seconds": 32.763,
    "text": "or electricity across the lines."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:33.297",
    "end": "00:00:34.999",
    "start_seconds": 33.297,
    "end_seconds": 34.999,
    "text": "Even the birds were gone."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:36.033",
    "end": "00:00:41.072",
    "start_seconds": 36.033,
    "end_seconds": 41.072,
    "text": "I'm best known for having pioneered something called immersive journalism,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:41.105",
    "end": "00:00:43.541",
    "start_seconds": 41.105,
    "end_seconds": 43.541,
    "text": "which uses emerging technologies"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:43.541",
    "end": "00:00:46.077",
    "start_seconds": 43.541,
    "end_seconds": 46.077,
    "text": "to create new stories that represent our world"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:46.110",
    "end": "00:00:47.878",
    "start_seconds": 46.11,
    "end_seconds": 47.878,
    "text": "the way it really is:"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:47.912",
    "end": "00:00:50.981",
    "start_seconds": 47.912,
    "end_seconds": 50.981,
    "text": "fully dimensional and not flat."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:51.682",
    "end": "00:00:54.952",
    "start_seconds": 51.682,
    "end_seconds": 54.952,
    "text": "People then can experience stories with their whole body"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:54.985",
    "end": "00:00:56.921",
    "start_seconds": 54.985,
    "end_seconds": 56.921,
    "text": "and not just with their eyes."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:58.522",
    "end": "00:00:59.990",
    "start_seconds": 58.522,
    "end_seconds": 59.99,
    "text": "Also, as a journalist,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:00.024",
    "end": "00:01:05.029",
    "start_seconds": 60.024,
    "end_seconds": 65.029,
    "text": "I feel that we have a moral responsibility to bear witness to injustice,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:05.062",
    "end": "00:01:07.431",
    "start_seconds": 65.062,
    "end_seconds": 67.431,
    "text": "to wonder, to the human condition."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:07.998",
    "end": "00:01:09.767",
    "start_seconds": 67.998,
    "end_seconds": 69.767,
    "text": "With immersive journalism,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:09.800",
    "end": "00:01:13.437",
    "start_seconds": 69.8,
    "end_seconds": 73.437,
    "text": "I am merging those new technologies with that code of ethics."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:14.004",
    "end": "00:01:15.840",
    "start_seconds": 74.004,
    "end_seconds": 75.84,
    "text": "I'm also founding director"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:15.873",
    "end": "00:01:18.309",
    "start_seconds": 75.873,
    "end_seconds": 78.309,
    "text": "for the Narrative and Emerging Media program"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:18.309",
    "end": "00:01:20.444",
    "start_seconds": 78.309,
    "end_seconds": 80.444,
    "text": "at Arizona State University."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:20.478",
    "end": "00:01:22.012",
    "start_seconds": 80.47800000000001,
    "end_seconds": 82.012,
    "text": "So when the fires broke out,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:22.046",
    "end": "00:01:25.082",
    "start_seconds": 82.04599999999999,
    "end_seconds": 85.082,
    "text": "I mobilized my colleagues and my graduate students,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:25.116",
    "end": "00:01:26.951",
    "start_seconds": 85.116,
    "end_seconds": 86.951,
    "text": "and we went out to cover,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:26.951",
    "end": "00:01:29.720",
    "start_seconds": 86.951,
    "end_seconds": 89.72,
    "text": "using our Cronkite journalism news passes"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:29.753",
    "end": "00:01:33.190",
    "start_seconds": 89.753,
    "end_seconds": 93.19,
    "text": "what firemen called “Nuketown.”"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:34.125",
    "end": "00:01:36.393",
    "start_seconds": 94.125,
    "end_seconds": 96.393,
    "text": "When we got there, the fires were basically out,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:36.393",
    "end": "00:01:38.729",
    "start_seconds": 96.393,
    "end_seconds": 98.729,
    "text": "so there wasn't anything anyone could really do."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:38.762",
    "end": "00:01:41.665",
    "start_seconds": 98.762,
    "end_seconds": 101.66499999999999,
    "text": "But when we'd run into a fire crew, they would rush over,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:41.699",
    "end": "00:01:44.835",
    "start_seconds": 101.699,
    "end_seconds": 104.83500000000001,
    "text": "and we thought, \"Wow, they're going to question our press passes.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:44.835",
    "end": "00:01:47.838",
    "start_seconds": 104.83500000000001,
    "end_seconds": 107.838,
    "text": "But no, they just wanted to help in any way that they could."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:47.872",
    "end": "00:01:52.009",
    "start_seconds": 107.872,
    "end_seconds": 112.009,
    "text": "And in our case, it was just water or granola bars."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:53.544",
    "end": "00:01:57.314",
    "start_seconds": 113.544,
    "end_seconds": 117.314,
    "text": "All of us were suffering from shock and sorrow"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:57.314",
    "end": "00:02:01.752",
    "start_seconds": 117.314,
    "end_seconds": 121.752,
    "text": "as the sole witnesses for the devastation around us."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:03.787",
    "end": "00:02:05.623",
    "start_seconds": 123.787,
    "end_seconds": 125.623,
    "text": "It was grueling work."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:05.656",
    "end": "00:02:08.325",
    "start_seconds": 125.656,
    "end_seconds": 128.325,
    "text": "The air was toxic, it was incredibly hot."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:08.692",
    "end": "00:02:11.362",
    "start_seconds": 128.692,
    "end_seconds": 131.362,
    "text": "We were wearing hazmat suits and heavy boots"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:11.395",
    "end": "00:02:13.130",
    "start_seconds": 131.395,
    "end_seconds": 133.13,
    "text": "and double-filtered masks."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:13.731",
    "end": "00:02:17.368",
    "start_seconds": 133.731,
    "end_seconds": 137.368,
    "text": "We were using specialized equipment designed by Mike Caronna,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:17.401",
    "end": "00:02:21.238",
    "start_seconds": 137.401,
    "end_seconds": 141.238,
    "text": "who is a photojournalist and the former general manager for Reuters."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:21.272",
    "end": "00:02:25.476",
    "start_seconds": 141.272,
    "end_seconds": 145.476,
    "text": "We had 3D-printed special parts that ... clamped to the top,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:25.509",
    "end": "00:02:27.678",
    "start_seconds": 145.50900000000001,
    "end_seconds": 147.678,
    "text": "middle and bottom of a pole,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:27.711",
    "end": "00:02:30.548",
    "start_seconds": 147.711,
    "end_seconds": 150.548,
    "text": "so we could shoot in every direction all at once."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:31.248",
    "end": "00:02:34.618",
    "start_seconds": 151.248,
    "end_seconds": 154.618,
    "text": "Each one of those dots represents a shot that we took,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:34.618",
    "end": "00:02:38.355",
    "start_seconds": 154.618,
    "end_seconds": 158.355,
    "text": "and then [they] would be fused together using artificial intelligence."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:38.389",
    "end": "00:02:42.826",
    "start_seconds": 158.389,
    "end_seconds": 162.826,
    "text": "I also used my phone to make very painstaking captures."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:43.194",
    "end": "00:02:46.096",
    "start_seconds": 163.19400000000002,
    "end_seconds": 166.096,
    "text": "You have to use your camera like a paintbrush"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:46.130",
    "end": "00:02:48.399",
    "start_seconds": 166.13,
    "end_seconds": 168.399,
    "text": "and get every bit, every angle,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:48.432",
    "end": "00:02:49.733",
    "start_seconds": 168.43200000000002,
    "end_seconds": 169.733,
    "text": "and at the same time,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:49.767",
    "end": "00:02:52.369",
    "start_seconds": 169.767,
    "end_seconds": 172.369,
    "text": "make sure that you're not stepping on upturned nails"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:52.403",
    "end": "00:02:54.772",
    "start_seconds": 172.403,
    "end_seconds": 174.772,
    "text": "or broken glass or shards of metal."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:55.773",
    "end": "00:02:58.375",
    "start_seconds": 175.773,
    "end_seconds": 178.375,
    "text": "This is my graduate student, Ashley Buschhorn."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:58.776",
    "end": "00:03:02.079",
    "start_seconds": 178.776,
    "end_seconds": 182.079,
    "text": "She was trying to capture a cactus that had been really weirdly burned"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:02.112",
    "end": "00:03:03.681",
    "start_seconds": 182.112,
    "end_seconds": 183.681,
    "text": "only on one side."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:07.384",
    "end": "00:03:09.987",
    "start_seconds": 187.38400000000001,
    "end_seconds": 189.987,
    "text": "I'd often look up and see my colleague Mary Mathieson,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:09.987",
    "end": "00:03:13.724",
    "start_seconds": 189.987,
    "end_seconds": 193.724,
    "text": "and she’d been taking the gear into these incredibly dangerous situations,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:13.757",
    "end": "00:03:16.427",
    "start_seconds": 193.757,
    "end_seconds": 196.427,
    "text": "determined to get the best scan possible."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:16.427",
    "end": "00:03:18.495",
    "start_seconds": 196.427,
    "end_seconds": 198.495,
    "text": "We scanned fallen angels,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:21.265",
    "end": "00:03:22.533",
    "start_seconds": 201.265,
    "end_seconds": 202.53300000000002,
    "text": "buddhas,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:25.469",
    "end": "00:03:27.271",
    "start_seconds": 205.469,
    "end_seconds": 207.27100000000002,
    "text": "melted trash cans,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:29.139",
    "end": "00:03:30.407",
    "start_seconds": 209.139,
    "end_seconds": 210.407,
    "text": "Teslas"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:33.010",
    "end": "00:03:34.411",
    "start_seconds": 213.01,
    "end_seconds": 214.411,
    "text": "[and] surf wagons."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:37.581",
    "end": "00:03:40.718",
    "start_seconds": 217.58100000000002,
    "end_seconds": 220.71800000000002,
    "text": "We filmed until the light was gone, every day."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:42.419",
    "end": "00:03:44.154",
    "start_seconds": 222.41899999999998,
    "end_seconds": 224.154,
    "text": "We even used our headlights"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.188",
    "end": "00:03:47.458",
    "start_seconds": 224.188,
    "end_seconds": 227.458,
    "text": "to capture this car that was sliding down the mountain."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:47.491",
    "end": "00:03:49.793",
    "start_seconds": 227.49099999999999,
    "end_seconds": 229.793,
    "text": "We didn't know if it would be there the next day."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:50.861",
    "end": "00:03:52.363",
    "start_seconds": 230.861,
    "end_seconds": 232.363,
    "text": "More than once,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:52.363",
    "end": "00:03:56.133",
    "start_seconds": 232.363,
    "end_seconds": 236.133,
    "text": "I'd have to leave the crew working and go sit in the car by myself."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:57.368",
    "end": "00:04:00.070",
    "start_seconds": 237.368,
    "end_seconds": 240.07,
    "text": "These weren't just places on a map."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:00.070",
    "end": "00:04:02.139",
    "start_seconds": 240.07,
    "end_seconds": 242.139,
    "text": "I grew up in and around these neighborhoods,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:02.172",
    "end": "00:04:05.242",
    "start_seconds": 242.172,
    "end_seconds": 245.242,
    "text": "and often we were scanning the homes of friends of mine."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:05.276",
    "end": "00:04:06.777",
    "start_seconds": 245.276,
    "end_seconds": 246.777,
    "text": "They hadn't even been back yet,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:06.810",
    "end": "00:04:09.346",
    "start_seconds": 246.81,
    "end_seconds": 249.346,
    "text": "they didn't even know the status of their own places."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:10.114",
    "end": "00:04:11.448",
    "start_seconds": 250.114,
    "end_seconds": 251.448,
    "text": "Like the cello teacher."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:11.915",
    "end": "00:04:14.118",
    "start_seconds": 251.915,
    "end_seconds": 254.118,
    "text": "This is a home we brought my son to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:14.118",
    "end": "00:04:15.819",
    "start_seconds": 254.118,
    "end_seconds": 255.819,
    "text": "for years, every weekend."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:19.256",
    "end": "00:04:23.093",
    "start_seconds": 259.256,
    "end_seconds": 263.093,
    "text": "This is a home where I held the baby shower for my first child."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:27.598",
    "end": "00:04:30.100",
    "start_seconds": 267.598,
    "end_seconds": 270.1,
    "text": "This is my sister's good friend's equipment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:30.467",
    "end": "00:04:32.903",
    "start_seconds": 270.467,
    "end_seconds": 272.903,
    "text": "She taught horseback riding at Will Rogers Park,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:32.903",
    "end": "00:04:34.305",
    "start_seconds": 272.903,
    "end_seconds": 274.305,
    "text": "and when the fires broke out,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:34.338",
    "end": "00:04:36.807",
    "start_seconds": 274.338,
    "end_seconds": 276.807,
    "text": "she rushed over to go rescue the horses,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:36.840",
    "end": "00:04:38.609",
    "start_seconds": 276.84000000000003,
    "end_seconds": 278.609,
    "text": "and then her own home burned,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:38.642",
    "end": "00:04:41.445",
    "start_seconds": 278.642,
    "end_seconds": 281.445,
    "text": "and everything she owned was also destroyed."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:41.445",
    "end": "00:04:43.380",
    "start_seconds": 281.445,
    "end_seconds": 283.38,
    "text": "This was a particularly difficult moment"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:43.380",
    "end": "00:04:48.285",
    "start_seconds": 283.38,
    "end_seconds": 288.28499999999997,
    "text": "because I was standing next to the wall that had collapsed over a bedroom,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:48.319",
    "end": "00:04:51.722",
    "start_seconds": 288.319,
    "end_seconds": 291.722,
    "text": "where I said goodbye to one of my best friends about a year earlier."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:51.755",
    "end": "00:04:54.258",
    "start_seconds": 291.755,
    "end_seconds": 294.258,
    "text": "She had died of cancer the next day."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:54.258",
    "end": "00:04:56.527",
    "start_seconds": 294.258,
    "end_seconds": 296.527,
    "text": "Her partner escaped with a small suitcase"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:56.560",
    "end": "00:04:59.897",
    "start_seconds": 296.56,
    "end_seconds": 299.897,
    "text": "and a loaf of bread from their favorite bakery."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:59.930",
    "end": "00:05:02.433",
    "start_seconds": 299.93,
    "end_seconds": 302.433,
    "text": "The thumbnail was completely black,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:02.466",
    "end": "00:05:04.001",
    "start_seconds": 302.466,
    "end_seconds": 304.001,
    "text": "which is incredibly strange"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:04.001",
    "end": "00:05:07.838",
    "start_seconds": 304.001,
    "end_seconds": 307.838,
    "text": "because none of my other thumbnails were like that on any of my scans."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:07.871",
    "end": "00:05:09.907",
    "start_seconds": 307.871,
    "end_seconds": 309.907,
    "text": "There was also some incredible stories."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:09.907",
    "end": "00:05:13.877",
    "start_seconds": 309.907,
    "end_seconds": 313.877,
    "text": "This was a house where my son spent most weekends during high school"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:13.911",
    "end": "00:05:15.546",
    "start_seconds": 313.911,
    "end_seconds": 315.546,
    "text": "with a bunch of his buddies."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:15.546",
    "end": "00:05:18.449",
    "start_seconds": 315.546,
    "end_seconds": 318.449,
    "text": "One of his buddies had been there the night before the fire,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:18.449",
    "end": "00:05:21.785",
    "start_seconds": 318.449,
    "end_seconds": 321.785,
    "text": "and he left his car in front of the house and took an Uber home"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:21.819",
    "end": "00:05:23.420",
    "start_seconds": 321.819,
    "end_seconds": 323.42,
    "text": "because they'd been out partying."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:23.454",
    "end": "00:05:25.556",
    "start_seconds": 323.454,
    "end_seconds": 325.556,
    "text": "They saw on Instagram an image"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:25.556",
    "end": "00:05:28.659",
    "start_seconds": 325.556,
    "end_seconds": 328.659,
    "text": "which seemed to indicate his car was totally intact."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:29.126",
    "end": "00:05:32.363",
    "start_seconds": 329.126,
    "end_seconds": 332.363,
    "text": "So I called him when we got there to describe what we were seeing,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:32.396",
    "end": "00:05:34.031",
    "start_seconds": 332.396,
    "end_seconds": 334.031,
    "text": "and it was extraordinary."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:34.064",
    "end": "00:05:36.300",
    "start_seconds": 334.064,
    "end_seconds": 336.3,
    "text": "Other than ashes on top, his car looked [to be]"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:36.300",
    "end": "00:05:38.535",
    "start_seconds": 336.3,
    "end_seconds": 338.53499999999997,
    "text": "in perfect condition."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:38.569",
    "end": "00:05:41.438",
    "start_seconds": 338.569,
    "end_seconds": 341.438,
    "text": "He later got into the car and just drove it away."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:42.106",
    "end": "00:05:44.541",
    "start_seconds": 342.106,
    "end_seconds": 344.541,
    "text": "Then there was the Bank of America building,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:44.575",
    "end": "00:05:47.177",
    "start_seconds": 344.575,
    "end_seconds": 347.177,
    "text": "where a lot of people had their safe deposit boxes,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:47.211",
    "end": "00:05:49.179",
    "start_seconds": 347.211,
    "end_seconds": 349.179,
    "text": "and they were told they'd been destroyed."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:49.179",
    "end": "00:05:52.516",
    "start_seconds": 349.179,
    "end_seconds": 352.516,
    "text": "They'd lost family heirlooms and Holocaust papers."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:52.916",
    "end": "00:05:57.421",
    "start_seconds": 352.916,
    "end_seconds": 357.421,
    "text": "But it turns out, underneath all this crazy rubble --"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:57.454",
    "end": "00:05:59.123",
    "start_seconds": 357.454,
    "end_seconds": 359.123,
    "text": "everything was safe."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:59.123",
    "end": "00:06:01.725",
    "start_seconds": 359.123,
    "end_seconds": 361.725,
    "text": "And here we were, taking these images,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:01.759",
    "end": "00:06:03.794",
    "start_seconds": 361.759,
    "end_seconds": 363.794,
    "text": "and there was nobody there guarding it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:05.963",
    "end": "00:06:08.966",
    "start_seconds": 365.963,
    "end_seconds": 368.966,
    "text": "Niantic, the company that makes Pokémon Go,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:08.966",
    "end": "00:06:10.934",
    "start_seconds": 368.966,
    "end_seconds": 370.934,
    "text": "learned about the work we were doing,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:10.968",
    "end": "00:06:13.170",
    "start_seconds": 370.968,
    "end_seconds": 373.17,
    "text": "and they used our material"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:13.170",
    "end": "00:06:16.707",
    "start_seconds": 373.17,
    "end_seconds": 376.707,
    "text": "to try to help folks who'd been impacted by the fire."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:17.074",
    "end": "00:06:19.376",
    "start_seconds": 377.074,
    "end_seconds": 379.376,
    "text": "And as a journalist, that's what you want, right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:19.376",
    "end": "00:06:20.811",
    "start_seconds": 379.376,
    "end_seconds": 380.811,
    "text": "You want your work to be used"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:20.811",
    "end": "00:06:24.014",
    "start_seconds": 380.811,
    "end_seconds": 384.014,
    "text": "in a way that can make an impact, that can help others."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:25.115",
    "end": "00:06:26.717",
    "start_seconds": 385.115,
    "end_seconds": 386.717,
    "text": "I also had a third motivation"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:26.750",
    "end": "00:06:29.386",
    "start_seconds": 386.75,
    "end_seconds": 389.386,
    "text": "about why I was doing the work I was doing."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:30.854",
    "end": "00:06:34.057",
    "start_seconds": 390.854,
    "end_seconds": 394.057,
    "text": "I really understood personally the helplessness"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:34.057",
    "end": "00:06:37.995",
    "start_seconds": 394.057,
    "end_seconds": 397.995,
    "text": "and just the feelings of loss,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:38.028",
    "end": "00:06:40.531",
    "start_seconds": 398.028,
    "end_seconds": 400.531,
    "text": "because a year and a half earlier,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:40.531",
    "end": "00:06:42.132",
    "start_seconds": 400.531,
    "end_seconds": 402.132,
    "text": "I'd had my own fire."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:51.975",
    "end": "00:06:55.913",
    "start_seconds": 411.975,
    "end_seconds": 415.913,
    "text": "This was my home studio where I'd lost everything personally"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:55.913",
    "end": "00:06:58.515",
    "start_seconds": 415.913,
    "end_seconds": 418.515,
    "text": "and professionally from pretty much my entire life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:58.549",
    "end": "00:07:02.019",
    "start_seconds": 418.549,
    "end_seconds": 422.019,
    "text": "During COVID, I had closed up my offices in Santa Monica"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:02.052",
    "end": "00:07:03.954",
    "start_seconds": 422.052,
    "end_seconds": 423.954,
    "text": "and I'd brought everything here."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:03.987",
    "end": "00:07:05.622",
    "start_seconds": 423.987,
    "end_seconds": 425.622,
    "text": "I mean, no one was coming to work,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:05.656",
    "end": "00:07:08.792",
    "start_seconds": 425.656,
    "end_seconds": 428.792,
    "text": "so this is where I thought it would be safe."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:11.995",
    "end": "00:07:13.197",
    "start_seconds": 431.995,
    "end_seconds": 433.197,
    "text": "It turned out,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:13.230",
    "end": "00:07:16.266",
    "start_seconds": 433.23,
    "end_seconds": 436.266,
    "text": "my electric bicycle battery had exploded."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:17.935",
    "end": "00:07:20.871",
    "start_seconds": 437.935,
    "end_seconds": 440.871,
    "text": "I lost projects and equipment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:21.305",
    "end": "00:07:24.975",
    "start_seconds": 441.305,
    "end_seconds": 444.975,
    "text": "I lost photos and video archives,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:24.975",
    "end": "00:07:28.245",
    "start_seconds": 444.975,
    "end_seconds": 448.245,
    "text": "diaries, family memories."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:29.413",
    "end": "00:07:30.714",
    "start_seconds": 449.413,
    "end_seconds": 450.714,
    "text": "I inhaled smoke."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:30.714",
    "end": "00:07:32.015",
    "start_seconds": 450.714,
    "end_seconds": 452.015,
    "text": "I burned my gums."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:32.049",
    "end": "00:07:33.617",
    "start_seconds": 452.049,
    "end_seconds": 453.617,
    "text": "I damaged my lungs."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:33.650",
    "end": "00:07:37.020",
    "start_seconds": 453.65,
    "end_seconds": 457.02,
    "text": "And I now have what might be a permanent neuropathy"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:37.054",
    "end": "00:07:38.355",
    "start_seconds": 457.054,
    "end_seconds": 458.355,
    "text": "in my esophagus."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:40.057",
    "end": "00:07:45.329",
    "start_seconds": 460.057,
    "end_seconds": 465.329,
    "text": "When I looked at the remains of what had been decades of my life,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:45.362",
    "end": "00:07:47.130",
    "start_seconds": 465.362,
    "end_seconds": 467.13,
    "text": "I just thought it was all gone."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:48.765",
    "end": "00:07:52.369",
    "start_seconds": 468.765,
    "end_seconds": 472.369,
    "text": "But a few strange things actually survived."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:52.402",
    "end": "00:07:55.939",
    "start_seconds": 472.402,
    "end_seconds": 475.939,
    "text": "This is a photo I took in college of one of my best friends."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:56.707",
    "end": "00:07:59.142",
    "start_seconds": 476.707,
    "end_seconds": 479.142,
    "text": "My husband of 27 years ago,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:59.142",
    "end": "00:08:03.380",
    "start_seconds": 479.142,
    "end_seconds": 483.38,
    "text": "he wrote me this love letter after our first date and it said,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:03.413",
    "end": "00:08:07.017",
    "start_seconds": 483.413,
    "end_seconds": 487.017,
    "text": "\"I think I see a kindred spirit in you, and if you invite me,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:07.050",
    "end": "00:08:09.353",
    "start_seconds": 487.05,
    "end_seconds": 489.353,
    "text": "I'll cross the country in a heartbeat.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:09.386",
    "end": "00:08:13.056",
    "start_seconds": 489.386,
    "end_seconds": 493.056,
    "text": "Well, I invited him and he asked me to marry him on our second date."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:13.590",
    "end": "00:08:16.894",
    "start_seconds": 493.59,
    "end_seconds": 496.894,
    "text": "I also used my scans with my battle with the insurance company."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:16.894",
    "end": "00:08:18.929",
    "start_seconds": 496.894,
    "end_seconds": 498.929,
    "text": "Like, they didn't want to pay on this sofa"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:18.962",
    "end": "00:08:20.497",
    "start_seconds": 498.962,
    "end_seconds": 500.497,
    "text": "because I didn’t have a receipt,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:20.497",
    "end": "00:08:22.566",
    "start_seconds": 500.497,
    "end_seconds": 502.566,
    "text": "and the receipt had been burned in the fire."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:22.566",
    "end": "00:08:25.168",
    "start_seconds": 502.566,
    "end_seconds": 505.168,
    "text": "My scans showed very clearly there was a sofa in there,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:25.168",
    "end": "00:08:26.537",
    "start_seconds": 505.168,
    "end_seconds": 506.537,
    "text": "and they had to pay on that."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:26.537",
    "end": "00:08:28.872",
    "start_seconds": 506.537,
    "end_seconds": 508.872,
    "text": "And it was one of the reasons why I was out there,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:28.906",
    "end": "00:08:30.207",
    "start_seconds": 508.906,
    "end_seconds": 510.207,
    "text": "scanning everybody's homes."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:30.240",
    "end": "00:08:34.311",
    "start_seconds": 510.24,
    "end_seconds": 514.311,
    "text": "I wanted them to be able to use what we had in any way that they could."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:34.745",
    "end": "00:08:37.981",
    "start_seconds": 514.745,
    "end_seconds": 517.981,
    "text": "Another thing strangely survived the fire."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:38.015",
    "end": "00:08:40.684",
    "start_seconds": 518.015,
    "end_seconds": 520.684,
    "text": "In 2009, I was at an event"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:40.684",
    "end": "00:08:43.153",
    "start_seconds": 520.684,
    "end_seconds": 523.153,
    "text": "at the University of Southern California,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:43.186",
    "end": "00:08:45.689",
    "start_seconds": 523.186,
    "end_seconds": 525.689,
    "text": "and Mark Hamill was at the adjacent table."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:46.089",
    "end": "00:08:49.159",
    "start_seconds": 526.0889999999999,
    "end_seconds": 529.159,
    "text": "Now, I grew up in LA, and normally I don't bug celebrities."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:49.192",
    "end": "00:08:52.296",
    "start_seconds": 529.192,
    "end_seconds": 532.296,
    "text": "I just let them go about their lives peacefully, right?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:52.329",
    "end": "00:08:55.098",
    "start_seconds": 532.329,
    "end_seconds": 535.098,
    "text": "But my son was six and I couldn't resist."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:55.132",
    "end": "00:08:57.768",
    "start_seconds": 535.132,
    "end_seconds": 537.768,
    "text": "I asked Mark Hamill to sign the program card."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:58.735",
    "end": "00:09:00.504",
    "start_seconds": 538.735,
    "end_seconds": 540.504,
    "text": "And that flammable,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:00.537",
    "end": "00:09:02.873",
    "start_seconds": 540.537,
    "end_seconds": 542.873,
    "text": "fragile piece of paper,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:02.906",
    "end": "00:09:05.475",
    "start_seconds": 542.906,
    "end_seconds": 545.475,
    "text": "it somehow survived a lithium-battery fire"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:05.509",
    "end": "00:09:07.210",
    "start_seconds": 545.509,
    "end_seconds": 547.21,
    "text": "that was so hot"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:07.244",
    "end": "00:09:10.047",
    "start_seconds": 547.244,
    "end_seconds": 550.047,
    "text": "that the fire folks said it had to burn its course."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:10.414",
    "end": "00:09:15.018",
    "start_seconds": 550.414,
    "end_seconds": 555.018,
    "text": "And there it was, like, it drifted right on top of the hellscape"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:15.052",
    "end": "00:09:17.120",
    "start_seconds": 555.052,
    "end_seconds": 557.12,
    "text": "that used to be my entire life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:18.488",
    "end": "00:09:21.391",
    "start_seconds": 558.488,
    "end_seconds": 561.391,
    "text": "And not only that, Mark Hamill wrote a message."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:23.193",
    "end": "00:09:26.129",
    "start_seconds": 563.193,
    "end_seconds": 566.129,
    "text": "\"The force will be with you always."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:26.163",
    "end": "00:09:27.898",
    "start_seconds": 566.163,
    "end_seconds": 567.898,
    "text": "Your pal, Mark Hamill.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:28.532",
    "end": "00:09:31.401",
    "start_seconds": 568.532,
    "end_seconds": 571.401,
    "text": "I can't help but take that message literally."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:32.169",
    "end": "00:09:35.172",
    "start_seconds": 572.169,
    "end_seconds": 575.172,
    "text": "The force, it's within us all."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:35.739",
    "end": "00:09:38.442",
    "start_seconds": 575.739,
    "end_seconds": 578.442,
    "text": "And it's not what we lose that defines us."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:38.875",
    "end": "00:09:40.277",
    "start_seconds": 578.875,
    "end_seconds": 580.277,
    "text": "It's who we love"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:40.310",
    "end": "00:09:42.980",
    "start_seconds": 580.31,
    "end_seconds": 582.98,
    "text": "and how we take that love forward."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:44.047",
    "end": "00:09:45.582",
    "start_seconds": 584.047,
    "end_seconds": 585.582,
    "text": "I know personally,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:45.616",
    "end": "00:09:48.151",
    "start_seconds": 585.616,
    "end_seconds": 588.151,
    "text": "when you’re looking at what [are] the remains"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:48.185",
    "end": "00:09:50.454",
    "start_seconds": 588.185,
    "end_seconds": 590.454,
    "text": "of what had been a vibrant life,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:50.487",
    "end": "00:09:53.123",
    "start_seconds": 590.487,
    "end_seconds": 593.123,
    "text": "you can't help but feel like everything is gone."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:54.224",
    "end": "00:09:56.793",
    "start_seconds": 594.224,
    "end_seconds": 596.793,
    "text": "But silence is not emptiness."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:57.127",
    "end": "00:10:00.263",
    "start_seconds": 597.127,
    "end_seconds": 600.263,
    "text": "It's a place to reflect and remember,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:00.297",
    "end": "00:10:03.867",
    "start_seconds": 600.297,
    "end_seconds": 603.867,
    "text": "to imagine the wild ways we can rebuild"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:03.900",
    "end": "00:10:06.903",
    "start_seconds": 603.9,
    "end_seconds": 606.903,
    "text": "and to consider what really endures."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:07.571",
    "end": "00:10:11.808",
    "start_seconds": 607.571,
    "end_seconds": 611.808,
    "text": "And now, as we come to the one-year anniversary of the fires,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:11.808",
    "end": "00:10:15.379",
    "start_seconds": 611.808,
    "end_seconds": 615.379,
    "text": "I'm calling on everyone to feel the force,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:15.412",
    "end": "00:10:17.814",
    "start_seconds": 615.412,
    "end_seconds": 617.814,
    "text": "to think about that love within you"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:17.848",
    "end": "00:10:20.083",
    "start_seconds": 617.848,
    "end_seconds": 620.083,
    "text": "and help support our friends,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:20.117",
    "end": "00:10:22.319",
    "start_seconds": 620.117,
    "end_seconds": 622.319,
    "text": "our neighbors, our communities."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:22.986",
    "end": "00:10:26.223",
    "start_seconds": 622.986,
    "end_seconds": 626.223,
    "text": "Together, we can rebuild Los Angeles,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:26.256",
    "end": "00:10:28.458",
    "start_seconds": 626.256,
    "end_seconds": 628.458,
    "text": "better and more resilient."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:29.660",
    "end": "00:10:30.827",
    "start_seconds": 629.66,
    "end_seconds": 630.827,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:30.861",
    "end": "00:10:33.330",
    "start_seconds": 630.861,
    "end_seconds": 633.33,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  }
]
